    "text": "Start A project Contact us Logpom, Douala, Cameroun contact@alivaon.com +237 6 91 96 21 58 Home About Our Services Portfolio Blog FAQ Contact CONTACT US Our Team Passionate experts, based in Douala A team of Cameroonian experts building software and applications to grow your business. OUR TEAM The Leadership Team \"We have made digital accessible to Cameroonian businesses.\" No team members to display yet. Built to transform the way you operate A local team with hands-on expertise A team of developers, project managers and domain experts based in Douala, who know the realities of Cameroonian businesses: variable connectivity, mobile-first usage, field teams. Simplicity & concrete results We don't sell technology - we deliver tools your teams actually use. Every project is designed to produce measurable gains: fewer errors, more sales, better management. We work as long-term partners. Direct communication, transparency at every step, and deliveries that respect the agreed deadlines and budget. 30 + Satisfied clients in Cameroon 50 + Projects successfully delivered 10 + Years of software development expertise 98 % Client satisfaction rate Would you like to work with our team? Tell us about your project. Contact our team - Free quote strategy marketing analysis marketing strategy marketing analysis marketing About Alivaon As a custom software company, we help businesses grow with innovative, reliable and sustainable web, mobile and enterprise solutions. Quick Links About Contact Portfolio Blog Our Services Resources FAQ Careers Our Team Legal Notice Privacy Policy Subscribe to our newsletter SUBSCRIBE SUBSCRIBE Copyright © 2026 Alivaon, All rights reserved.",
